  "prefLabel": "Bcr 215.02 Definitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bcr 215.02 Definitions. For the purpose of this part, the following terms shall be defined as follows:\n\n(a) “Evidence” means all information, other than oral argument, submitted and considered by the board as part of the appeal record.\n\n(b) “Licensing board” means the electricians’ board, established under RSA 319-C:4, or the board of home inspectors, established under RSA 310-A:186.\n\nSource. #8323, eff 4-12-05; ss by #10161, eff 7-13-12; amd by #12620, eff 9-18-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bcr200.html"
